.TH "GF-ACCESS-CONTROL-LIST-TEAMS-ROLES" "1" "May 2026" "" ""

.SH NAME
gf-access-control-list-teams-roles - Lists roles assigned to multiple teams


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgf access-control list-teams-roles [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Lists roles assigned to multiple teams

.PP
Lists the roles that have been directly assigned to the given teams.

.PP
You need to have a permission with action \fBteams.roles:read\fR and scope \fBteams:id:*\fR\&.

.PP
Body schema (RolesSearchQuery):
  includeHidden  boolean
  orgId          number
  teamIds        array
  userIds        array


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--body\fP=""
	Request body JSON or path to a JSON file (e.g. --body=/path/to/body.json, --body='{"foo": "bar"}'). The 'Body schema' block below lists fields and types; use --describe-body-jsonschema for a strict JSON Schema. [required]

.PP
\fB--describe-body-jsonschema\fP[=false]
	Print the JSON Schema of the request body and exit without calling the API

.PP
\fB--describe-response-jsonschema\fP[=false]
	Print the JSON Schema of the response payload and exit without calling the API

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for list-teams-roles

.PP
\fB--raw\fP[=false]
	Print the raw HTTP response body instead of the decoded payload


